*join* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''join(array, separator)''

Joins all elements of a list into a single string with separator.

*Parameters:*
- ''array'': List of values to join
- ''separator'': String to insert between elements

*Returns:*
- String: Joined string with elements separated by separator

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if array is not a list
- Runtime error if separator is not a string
